      <activity id="d4026302-f28d-5df5-9731-4d09a6da4c59" activityNameId="5fa5b26a-24b9-572d-8ded-ec7072d510d8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium natural, in yellowcake, at in-situ leaching mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium natural, in yellowcake, at in-situ leaching mine
PSI data (BFE project 407, Christian Bauer, April 2012).;
UUID: 3f40afb0-2d2b-3789-9da7-a0f8cdc435b5
Uranium production and mining site underground remediation. Process energy for pumping. Sulfuric acid and water consumption. Piping material consumption. Isolation of pollutant concentrate during remediation. Landfilling of isolate.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Generic ISL process with overall uranium recovery of 75%. Assumed depth of ore body is 120m and assumed vertical dimension of ore body is 15m. Assumed hexagonal injection field with 20m grid edge and central production well.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3f40afb0-2d2b-3789-9da7-a0f8cdc435b5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
